      "no": "01",
      "title": { "zh": "我们是谁", "en": "Who We Are" },
      "title_en": "Who We Are",
      "lede": {
        "zh": "示例公司是一家专注特殊钢的贸易公司：只做模具钢与特种合金，不做建筑用钢。",
        "en": "Example Steel is a special-steel trading house: tool and special alloy steels only — no construction steel."
      },
      "spreads": [
        {
          "id": "sp-pf-image",
          "layout": "D10",
          "side": "both",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "mode": "full",
              "src": "images/placeholder-wide.svg",
              "no": "FIG.01",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "锻造生产线（示意图，送印前替换为实拍图 ≥300dpi 全出血）",
                "en": "Forging line (placeholder — replace with on-site photo ≥300dpi full bleed before printing)"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sp-pf-text",
          "layout": "D04",
          "side": "both",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "cols": 2,
              "title": { "zh": "定位与边界", "en": "Positioning & Boundaries" },
              "paras": [
                {
                  "zh": "我们把资源集中在一件事上：特殊钢。模具钢、特种合金、航空与结构合金，按英制或公制规格交付，附带全套认证文件。建筑用钢出口税负没有优势，我们不做。",
                  "en": "We concentrate on one thing: special steels. Tool, special, aero and structural alloys, delivered in imperial or metric sizes with full documentation. Construction steel carries no export advantage — we do not trade it."
                },
                {
                  "zh": "差异化不在价格。英制规格在中国钢材市场是一道裂缝，多数钢厂以公制为默认生产语言；稳定供应英制尺寸加冷轧表面，需要单独的排产与公差控制能力。",
                  "en": "The differentiator is not price. Imperial sizing is a crack in the Chinese steel market: most mills default to metric. Stable imperial supply with cold-rolled finish requires dedicated scheduling and tolerance control."
                },
                {
                  "zh": "客户买的不是公差，是确定感。文件怎么写，货就怎么交；这一条没有商量余地。",
                  "en": "Customers buy certainty, not tolerance. The documents match the goods. This is not negotiable."
                }
              ],
              "pull": {
                "q": { "zh": "777 件标准件询盘，不值一个知道该把 9310 卖给谁的大脑。", "en": "Seven hundred commodity RFQs are worth less than one mind that knows who needs 9310." },
                "who": { "zh": "经营口径", "en": "Operating principle" }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sp-pf-stats",
          "layout": "D11",
          "side": "both",
          "blocks": [
