      "lede": {
        "zh": "贸易前端 + 锻造后端。前端管询价、核价、单据与交付；后端保熔炼、锻制与热处理。",
        "en": "Trading front end plus forging back end: the front handles enquiry, costing, documentation and delivery; the back secures melting, forging and heat treatment."
